# assets.directory is "." in wrangler.jsonc, so anything NOT listed here
# becomes a public URL on andreas-nyberg.com. Negation (!) is unreliable in
# this file, so every non-served path is listed explicitly.
#
# Files intentionally served: index.html, andreas.jpeg, andreas-nyberg-cv.pdf,
# og-image.png, apple-touch-icon.png, favicon.svg
#
# Also served: pomperipossa/ (unlisted story page for family, noindex, not
# linked from index.html). Everything in that folder is public by URL.
# The mp3s there are served through worker.js, which adds byte-range
# support that iOS Safari needs. worker.js itself is never served.
#
# When adding a working file to the repo root, add it here too.

.git
.git/**
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.wrangler
.wrangler/**
.gstack
.gstack/**
.memsearch
.memsearch/**
.DS_Store
node_modules
node_modules/**
*.md
wrangler.jsonc
worker.js

# everything retired lives here
archive
archive/**

# CV source and dated copy (the served download is andreas-nyberg-cv.pdf)
Andreas Nyberg CV (standalone).html
Andreas-Nyberg-CV-2026-08-11.pdf

# og-image.png generators, not served themselves
og-image.html
og-image.svg
